WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
{OP}

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:11.860
It's finished-kuru!

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.870
Oh, you put a Décor on it!

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.500
Hey, come look at this!

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:20.290
We'll look at it later, okay?

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.030
Kuru?

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:31.210
What're you all doing? Is it art season or something?

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:33.180
But it's not even summer yet...

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:35.620
We're making presents for our mothers.

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:36.610
Presents?

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:38.350
You know, for Mother's Day.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.550
Mother's Day? When's that again?

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:42.020
It's today, you doof!

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:42.890
Today?!

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:45.360
So, what are you giving your mom, Miyuki?

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.860
P-Presents...

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:51.800
What's the matter-kuru?

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.700
I totally forgot it was Mother's Day!

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:04.530
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.360
Smile Precure!

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:07.260
Let's go!

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:08.800
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:09.930
All together!

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:11.530
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:13.730
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:16.440
Smile Precure!

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:21.240
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:26.680
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:27.050 --> 00:01:31.890
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:37.830
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:42.760
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:42.730
So bright!

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:47.940
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:54.380
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:54.880
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:55.410 --> 00:01:56.040
Let's go!

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:58.750
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:01.680
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:06.490
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:07.050
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:08.720
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:09.860
Everybody!

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:11.530
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:14.060
Fly to the future!

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.570
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:19.730
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:22.040
Smile Precure!

00:02:28.990 --> 00:02:30.780
Whoa there!

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:32.600
Huh, a sweet?

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:33.860
You can have it-da wasa.

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:34.890
Huh? Really?

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:39.110
I got enough to last me-da wasa. You can have one as a present.

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:41.000
How unlike you.

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:47.260
The heck is this?! It's disgusting!

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:50.210
How dare you-da wasa! Do you know what I went through to get those nattou gyouza sweets?!

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:52.440
Give it a rest! Who'd want to eat this garbage?!

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:56.650
Fine then! That's the last time I give you a present-da wasa!

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:02.190
Man, presents aren't all they're cracked up to be.

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:14.390
Oh man, I'd have totally forgotten about Mother's Day.

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:16.270
You're so forgetful, Miyuki-kuru!

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:22.920
But I've still got time! I can go buy mom an awesome present for Mother's Day!

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:23.640
Kuru!

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:27.380
What can you buy with this-kuru?

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:28.810
I can't buy anything...

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:30.130
Then what are you gonna do-kuru?

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:31.880
There's nothing I can do...

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:36.020
I can't buy anything with this...

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.020
Kuru...

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.580
What is Mother's Day, anyway-kuru?

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:40.690
Wait, you don't know?!

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:46.020
Mother's Day is a day where we appreciate our moms for all the stuff they do for us every day.

00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:47.020
Appreciate...?

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:49.500
In other words, it's for saying "thank you"!

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:50.720
Kuru!

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:53.230
I wanna say thank you to you-kuru!

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:54.670
What should I get you-kuru?

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:58.070
You don't have to get me anything, really...

00:03:58.640 --> 00:03:59.610
Hey!

00:04:00.020 --> 00:04:02.680
That's it! I can save Mother's Day!

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.580
I'll help too-kuru!

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:08.490
Okay, but we'd better make sure Mom doesn't see you!

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:15.280
I don't have to actually get her anything to brighten up her day.

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:22.880
You're washing up? Let me help!

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:24.640
Oh, thank you.

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:29.570
Well, between the two of us, that didn't take long. Thank you.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:34.300
<i>Mom looks really happy! I guess this thing kinda counts, right?</i>

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:38.450
<i>If I can find more ways to help out, that'll really make her day!</i>

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:41.060
Is there anything else I can do to help?

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:43.550
What's gotten into you, dear?

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:45.550
Well, it's Mother's Day today, right?

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:47.750
So I wanna do whatever I can to help!

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:49.840
Oh, I see.

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:52.160
Then I guess I'll take you up on that!

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:55.970
What's this-kuru?

00:04:55.970 --> 00:04:57.230
I'm doing the laundry.

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:58.850
Laundry-kuru?

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:02.170
Yup! It's a real pain to do each day...

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:05.720
Just add the detergent, and...

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:10.070
Alright, done!

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:11.650
Done-kuru!

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:15.220
<i>I know!</i>

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.110
Have some coffee while you read!

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:21.670
Thank you, dear.

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:25.500
I made it with plenty of milk, just how you like it!

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:28.230
How is it? Good?

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:30.560
What's wrong?

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:38.810
Excuse me for a second...

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:44.510
That's so salty! Don't tell me...

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:49.180
I knew it! I mixed up the salt and sugar!

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:50.560
Good job, me...

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:53.800
You can't drink that, mom!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.430
Huh? W-Wha?!

00:05:57.950 --> 00:06:00.690
Oh man, I put bath foam in by accident!

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:02.310
Now what am I gonna do?!

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:04.130
We can just wash them again, dear.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:08.060
I'm sorry...

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:15.730
At least she'll be happy sleeping on a nice fluffy mattress again tonight!

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:16.680
Really happy-kuru!

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:21.610
Alright, that'll do.

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.070
Time to clean!

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:25.020
Clean-kuru!

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:28.570
Cleaning, cleaning~

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:30.860
I'll make the whole house spotless!

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:34.400
Oh man!

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:38.200
Mi-Miyuki...?

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:45.940
Are you alright, dear?

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:53.520
I was trying to help, and all I did was make an even bigger mess!

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:58.070
What can I do to make mom happy...?

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:00.420
Hey, wait...

00:07:04.350 --> 00:07:06.630
The others were all making stuff...

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:08.760
They looked like they were having fun-kuru!

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:09.720
Having fun...?

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:10.630
Yeah-kuru!

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:14.560
That's why I wanted to make something too-kuru!

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:18.320
Hey... that's right! I can make something myself!

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:22.580
I didn't think I could get her a present without any money...

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:26.320
Alright, it's settled! I'll make something myself!

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:30.810
I'll give my mom something awesome as a present, and make her <i>ultra happy</i>!

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:31.790
Kuru!

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:34.750
Huh, so you wanna make somethin' too?

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:38.300
Right... but I don't really know what I should make her.

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:41.230
So I wondered what you all made...

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:44.700
Well, mine's a bit embarrassing...

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:50.430
That's quite the excellent portrait.

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:51.980
Brilliant as ever, Yayoi-chan!

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:53.380
What about you, Akane-chan?

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:55.340
I made this!

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:59.310
I thought I'd sew her a special apron to wear 'round the restaurant...

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:03.020
But I went overboard and kinda sewed my fingers.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:04.420
Are you alright?!

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:05.620
I'm fine, really.

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:09.030
You're more clumsy than I thought, Akane.

00:08:09.270 --> 00:08:11.500
What about you, Nao-chan?

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:12.730
I made...

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:14.200
This tissue holder!

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:15.800
Oh, what beautiful embroidery!

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:18.170
Nao is quite skillfull at handcrafts.

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:20.290
I didn't know you could do that!

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:22.780
Well, I had to stitch up my brothers' clothes a lot...

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:24.410
I kinda got good after a while...

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:26.500
So, what did you make, Reika-chan?

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:27.380
A clay ornament?

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:31.250
Oh, it's not an ornament, it's usable.

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:32.320
Usable?

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:37.290
As my mother is always taking care of me, I decided I'd make her this teacup to relax with.

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:39.500
Wow, Reika-chan...

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:41.760
You're in a class of your own!

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:44.510
So then, Miyuki-san.

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:47.510
Why not use your own talents to make something for your mother?

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:52.100
Okay, use my talents. Like what?

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:55.060
Well, like...

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:56.890
Like what?

00:08:56.890 --> 00:09:00.440
Huh... Well, uh...

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:01.440
Like what?

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:05.610
Ummm... L-Like what?

00:09:05.610 --> 00:09:07.850
Well, ya know...

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:09.420
Like what?

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:15.030
This is pointless!

00:09:15.470 --> 00:09:18.710
What am I even good at, anyway?

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:21.430
Kuru?

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:25.200
Hey, that's it!

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:26.750
Kuru...?

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:30.810
I can still taste that thing...

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.280
God, I feel terrible...

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:39.070
Fine then! I can cheer myself up by gathering up a flurry of Bad Energy!

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:45.610
Happy!

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:52.530
Candy!

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:55.670
A necklace?

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:56.550
Yup!

00:09:56.550 --> 00:09:58.640
I thought I could use this to make one...

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:00.040
Hey, nice idea!

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:02.840
How about making the charm by hand, then?

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.040
Sounds good!

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:05.050
Alright then!

00:10:05.050 --> 00:10:05.710
Okay!

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:07.550
Let's get to work-kuru!

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:10.580
Right then! Let's make a beautiful necklace!

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:11.690
Kuru! Kuru!

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:33.980
Done!

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:37.910
But it's kinda...

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:40.540
...kinda really ugly.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:45.870
Why am I so useless at everything?

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:48.390
I don't think it's that bad, really.

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:51.020
We can just use the Star Décor-kuru!

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:54.080
No, don't!

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:57.200
I want to do it myself!

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:58.780
Let's Go: Star!

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:07.530
Kuru~!

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.160
It made me pretty instead-kuru!

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:15.730
Maybe I just shouldn't give it to her...

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:16.900
The heck?!

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:18.820
You went to all that trouble to make it...

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:21.790
Well, how about writing a message for her in a card?

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:25.130
Just make a little note to go with the present.

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:28.450
Hey, I know a place that does really nice cards!

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:30.470
Ya wanna come take a look with me?

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:32.410
A message in a card...

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:34.960
Alright, let's go look!

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:36.370
That's the way!

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:40.540
Now then...

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:42.640
The heck?

00:11:43.150 --> 00:11:45.110
Thank you!

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:48.810
"Mother's Day"?

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:50.820
Here, mommy!

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:53.010
It's my Mother's Day present!

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:55.770
Oh, thank you, sweetie.

00:11:56.490 --> 00:11:59.730
Presents? Please, god, no.

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:03.560
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:06.400
...a Bad End!

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:10.400
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness!

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:15.190
Kuru!?

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:17.920
It's Wolfrun-kuru!

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:29.560
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, Pierrot-sama!

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:34.160
Stop!

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:42.540
All these people came here to buy carnations for Mother's Day...

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:46.240
And he just... we have to stop him!

00:12:49.940 --> 00:12:51.210
Ready?

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:54.560
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:55.810
Go!

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:57.930
Go, go!

00:12:58.270 --> 00:12:59.770
Let's go!

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:31.190
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:34.210
Cure Happy!

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:38.940
Dazzling sun!

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:40.840
Hot-blooded power!

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:43.420
Cure Sunny!

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:49.270
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:52.530
Cure Peace!

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:58.040
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:01.030
Cure March!

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:07.040
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:10.020
Cure Beauty!

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:14.540
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:24.660
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:30.480
You know, I'm just about mad enough to break out the red nose today.

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:33.410
Come on out, Akanbe!

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:38.390
Akanbe!

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:40.810
Take care of my necklace for me, okay?

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:41.740
Kuru!

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:43.180
Get them!

00:14:43.180 --> 00:14:46.420
Akanbe!

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:01.170
Akan... be!

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:02.810
What is this...?

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:08.040
Huh?! What?!

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:09.850
It's pollen!

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:12.690
Are you alright, Beauty-kuru?

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:15.080
Akanbe!

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:15.880
Watch out!

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.780
Kuru!

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:22.120
Now's your chance!

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:23.280
That's it!

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:25.030
You've got it, Happy-kuru!

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:36.850
Don't give up, Happy-kuru!

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:40.440
That runt's being really annoying today...

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:43.260
Akanbe, take them all out!

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:44.780
Akanbe!

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.220
Kuru!

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:46.950
Candy!

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:00.200
The heck's this?

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:03.340
My Mother's Day present!

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:04.220
Give that back!

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:05.270
Hold on, there!

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:08.110
This thing's a present?

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:11.040
You kids buy into that rubbish too, huh?

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:12.920
What'd you say?!

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:15.380
Happy worked so hard to make that!

00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:17.990
Wait, she made this?!

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:20.820
I thought it was bad, but I didn't realize why!

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:25.760
Like anyone would want to be given this piece of junk!

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:27.280
How dare you!

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:29.150
He's right, though...

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:30.130
Happy?

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:33.640
It's really bad, when you look at it...

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:38.470
There's no way my mom would want it...

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:44.710
Don't be so stupid, Happy.

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:48.290
You wanna give that back?

00:16:49.590 --> 00:16:52.550
Nah... you're gonna give it back!

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:58.290
You little...

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:02.260
Ya know, the present I made was pretty bad too. But, thing is...

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:09.500
Regardless of how good it is, she put her heart and soul into making it!

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:15.940
Kuru!

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:19.610
Like anyone would care about that piece of junk!

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:21.220
Akanbe!

00:17:21.590 --> 00:17:22.230
Kuru!

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:25.450
What?!

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:29.420
It's not a question of whether something is good or not...!

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:35.960
Akanbe...

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:41.600
What really matters is the love for your mom that you put into it!

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:49.960
That's right... it's the thought that counts!

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:53.480
It doesn't matter if our presents look pretty or not!

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:56.950
Everyone here must feel the same way...

00:17:57.180 --> 00:18:00.030
We all want to thank our moms for what they do for us...

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:02.920
That's why we made them presents!

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:04.620
Happy!

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:08.460
Let's take this guy down, so we can go give our moms their presents!

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:16.070
How pathetic! I'll take your kind thoughts and your presents and crush them into Bad Energy!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:18.970
You think we'll let you do that?

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:21.740
Akanbe!

00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:35.820
Dang it! Do something, Akanbe!

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:38.280
Akan... be!

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:43.730
What?!

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:46.270
Where'd they go?!

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:49.170
There they are!

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:50.220
Akanbe!

00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:51.140
Akanbe!

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:00.480
What?!

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:04.750
But how-?!

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:06.650
It doesn't matter how good my present is!

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:10.220
I just want to say thank you to my mom!

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:12.660
You can do it, Happy-kuru!

00:19:12.660 --> 00:19:14.300
Precure...

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:18.070
Happy...

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:20.000
Shower!

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:31.730
Akanbe!

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:37.680
Kuru~

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:42.020
It's the Juice Décor-kuru!

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:45.240
Not even the red nose was enough?! Damn it!

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:52.400
It's ruined...

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:55.670
Miyuki... I'm sorry-kuru.

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:58.760
Oh, it's not your fault, Candy.

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:02.370
Besides... it's not like it was even that good to begin with.

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:02.950
Oh my!

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:03.840
Kuru?!

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:05.440
Miyuki!

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:07.380
Mom!

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:10.360
You're out with your friends?

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:11.440
Yeah...

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:13.210
What's the matter?

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:14.890
Oh, nothing...

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:17.630
Miyuki!

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:18.800
Candy!

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:25.710
Hey, mom...

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:30.040
Here... your Mother's Day present.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:33.600
Oh...

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:39.050
You made this for me, Miyuki?

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:44.790
I know it's not that good, but...

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:53.790
No... it's lovely, dear.

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:09.840
I'm sorry about today... I know I wasn't much help.

00:21:09.840 --> 00:21:12.780
It's alright. You made me a very happy mother.

00:21:12.780 --> 00:21:15.280
Even though I kept messing up?

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:21.030
You did your best to try and help me today, Miyuki.

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:24.290
That's all I could ask for.

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:27.490
And you made me this lovely present, too!

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:29.760
So thank you, Miyuki.

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:56.490
Thank you, mom! I love you!

00:23:39.370 --> 00:23:41.110
I resign as a Precure!

00:23:42.010 --> 00:23:43.230
You've gotta be kidding!

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:45.920
I'm quitting student council, archery club and my studies!

00:23:45.930 --> 00:23:46.420
But why?!

00:23:46.420 --> 00:23:47.680
Why would you-?!

00:23:47.680 --> 00:23:50.690
I can't abide this when I don't even know what it is I want to do with my life!

00:23:50.690 --> 00:23:52.520
You should just quit quitting things!

00:23:52.520 --> 00:23:56.560
I quit quitting quitting things! Therefore, I quit <i>everything</i>!

00:23:56.960 --> 00:23:58.760
Smile Precure:

00:24:01.700 --> 00:24:04.450
Find your ultra happy smile!
